<title>JAPAN: Rengo - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Rengo - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		118.29		vs	  119.07</p>
<p> Operating	    4.94		vs	    2.05</p>
<p> Current		4.29		vs	    1.29</p>
<p> Net		    1.71		vs	  453    million</p>
